// Handwritten Wildflower config for the embedded patient-browser SPA.
//
// This file is committed and served verbatim at
// `/installed-apps/patient-browser/config/default.json5` by vendor-apps-rust's
// build.rs — it replaces the old approach of string-rewriting upstream's
// `config/r4.json5` at build time, and overrides any `config/default.json5`
// shipped in the vendored dist.
//
// The two Wildflower-specific values are:
//   - `url`     -> the on-device FHIR R4 server (was the public SMART sandbox)
//   - `timeout` -> a long request timeout for slow local/first-load fetches
//
// TODO(needs upstream content): the previous build step served the FULL
// upstream `r4.json5` with only `url`/`timeout` changed, so it carried every
// other patient-browser setting too. Paste the rest of upstream's config fields
// here (with `url`/`timeout` kept as below) so the served config matches what
// the app expects.
{
  url: '/fhir-r4',
  timeout: 600000,
}
